  "releaseNotes": "Ported five wrapper-backed Root observations: GetApplicationVersion, GetBaseUnit, GetInputUnitForForce, GetInputUnitForLength and GetMainWindowHandle. Reused cached native metadata without additional COM calls, preserved unit fallback and non-owning window semantics, and added owner-thread, refresh and disposal guards. Included complete interface/concrete XML IntelliSense and Root usage guidance. Other domain operations remain pending.",
